Message-ID: <X62w--K6Sso.YTRWVl-ZBAAJ@bioc-ggtree.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <X62w--K6Sso.RTFR5gpaAwAJ@bioc-ggtree.groups.google.com>
References: <X62w--K6Sso.RTFR5gpaAwAJ@bioc-ggtree.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/bioc-ggtree/c/X62w--K6Sso/m/YTRWVl-ZBAAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

I've found the solution, use unicode for the label:

p = ggtree(tree) %<+% meta + geom_tiplab(aes(color = group)) +
       guides(color = guide_legend(override.aes = list(label = "\u25A0", size = 7)))

Hope this helps someone else.

